# The build context is this directory. Podman reads this file too when no
# .containerignore is present, so one file covers both builders.
#
# Documentation and the sample devfile are for humans and are never COPYed.
# MIRRORS.md in particular documents the build without being read by it — it
# must not become an input, or it would be a second source of truth for the
# pins that live in the Containerfile.
README.md
MIRRORS.md
devfile.yaml
